{{Quote|You'll never meet a more dishonest bunch of reprobates.|[[CR-8R]], on Jablogians|<ref name="The Snare" />}}
'''Jablogians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] of [[Nar Kanji]]. They were noted for their overweight torsos, blemished [[Color|red]] skin, pointed [[ear]]s and beady [[eye]]s.<ref name="The Snare" /> [[Azmorigan]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> [[Drahric]]<ref name="The Ganguls">{{YJA|The Ganguls}}</ref> and [[Nazgorigan]] were members of that species. The species shared its name with<ref name="The Snare" /> the [[Jablogian (language)|language of the same name]], which was spoken by<ref name="SWKids">{{SWKidsYouTube|series=Star Wars By the Numbers|text=Every Language in Star Wars Movies|video=CZp8Civk2co|nolive=1}}</ref> the [[human]] [[Tasu Leech]].<ref name="TFA">{{Film|VII}}</ref>

==Biology and appearance==
{{Quote|Observe the blemished red skin, the beady yellow eyes and the unsightly rolls.''"<br />"''You might also want to observe the pointed ears that can hear every word that rust-bucket of yours is saying!|CR-8R and Nazgorigan|<ref name="The Snare" />}}
Jablogians had deep red skin and green eyes. They also had large heads and short limbs in proportion to their bodies. They had pointy ears, four fingers on each hand, and a big chin with a throat pouch.<ref name="The Snare" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:EarlyJabba-ROJSketchbook.png|thumb|200px|An early sketch of Jabba the Hutt that inspired the look for the Jablogian species]]
Jablogians' appearance is based on the early concept art for [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] the [[Hutt]], developed during pre-production for [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']],<ref name="Idiot's Array Trivia">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/idiots-array-trivia-gallery|text="Idiot's Array" Trivia Gallery}}</ref> as is also the case for [[Dyslogia Twang]] from the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] book ''[[Monsters and Aliens from George Lucas]]''.<ref name="ROJSk">''[[Return of the Jedi Sketchbook]]''</ref>

